1
00:00:03,207 --> 00:00:05,190
Riley is a company admin.

2
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:10,691
Riley's Company page, under Your account, lists the orders waiting for approval:

3
00:00:10,691 --> 00:00:13,697
who asked, why, and what is in the order.

4
00:00:14,155 --> 00:00:17,323
Riley can add a note for the buyer, such as why it was

5
00:00:17,323 --> 00:00:19,382
approved, and then click Approve.

6
00:00:19,382 --> 00:00:23,817
Reject would cancel the order instead, so the buyer would have to start again.

7
00:00:23,817 --> 00:00:26,615
The buyer is emailed either way, with the note.

8
00:00:27,065 --> 00:00:31,357
The page also shows the company's monthly budget and what has been spent,

9
00:00:31,357 --> 00:00:35,105
and every order of the company, with its purchase order number.

